WEBVTT

00:03.810 --> 00:08.820
Mother, I've come to Spain, and I saw a bullfight for the first time in my life.

00:10.150 --> 00:15.620
Just what could be hidden behind both a brilliant matador and a flamenco dancer?

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
NAAJA

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
Nadja,

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
With your eyes

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
Nadja,

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
NAAJA

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
What do you see?

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
Nani ga mieru

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Shining in the far distance,

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
The door to the future,

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
Mirai no tobira

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
That's what I'm searching for

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
Sagashite iru

00:43.560 --> 00:50.780
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
Minna egao de aetara

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
It could be so much more fun

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
I can't see the end of the journey

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
Tabi no owari wa mienai

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
God is the only one who could possibly know

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
I will go waving

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
Te wo furinagara

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
But I won't look back

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
Ushiro mukanai

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Until the day my dream comes true

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
Nadja, Your smile

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
Nadja, gives me courage

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Under the blue sky,

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Aoi sora no shita de

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
I will find the place

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
Ashita no yukue

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
where my future lies

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
Mitsukeru kara

02:17.760 --> 02:20.430
﻿A hero of Spain, Jose Rodriguez.

02:21.850 --> 02:24.720
﻿It seems as if he's finally become a man worthy of me, hasn't he.

02:34.050 --> 02:39.010
The Return of the Beautiful Betrayer

02:39.530 --> 02:40.490
﻿Tomorrow?

02:41.950 --> 02:45.200
﻿I was thinking that I should try the flamenco for tomorrow's performance.

02:45.490 --> 02:49.250
﻿I see. I wonder how much the audience would pay to see you dance.

02:49.500 --> 02:51.120
﻿Oh well, you might as well try.

02:51.230 --> 02:51.810
Yes!

02:59.300 --> 03:01.720
﻿Hola, Señora Anselma.

03:03.890 --> 03:04.850
﻿Carmen!

03:05.260 --> 03:07.060
﻿Wow, what a beautiful person...

03:07.600 --> 03:08.890
﻿What did you come here for?

03:09.180 --> 03:11.190
﻿I just had some business in Barcelona.

03:11.400 --> 03:13.020
﻿So I thought salutations were in order.

03:13.480 --> 03:16.440
﻿Hmph. You've got a lot of nerve, showing your face around here.

03:16.610 --> 03:17.940
﻿That mouth of yours.

03:18.030 --> 03:19.940
﻿You haven't changed at all, Señora.

03:21.070 --> 03:23.570
﻿This stage brings back memories.

03:25.530 --> 03:26.830
﻿Ah! W-Wait!

03:28.950 --> 03:30.000
﻿Carmen!

03:42.470 --> 03:44.430
﻿A-Amazing...

03:49.520 --> 03:52.600
﻿The only ones who can step on this stage are flamenco dancers!

03:53.440 --> 03:55.860
﻿Flamenco dancers?

03:56.480 --> 03:58.320
﻿Just leave already!

04:02.400 --> 04:04.160
﻿Senora, who was that just now?

04:04.610 --> 04:07.370
﻿She was a pupil I used to teach the flamenco to a long time ago.

04:07.740 --> 04:09.790
﻿She was my most prized pupil.

04:10.910 --> 04:12.040
﻿Wow...

04:14.210 --> 04:17.290
﻿Nadja, don't concern yourself with that Carmen.

04:19.460 --> 04:20.960
﻿Thank you very much!

04:28.430 --> 04:30.140
﻿It's a new poster of Jose!

04:37.610 --> 04:39.860
﻿The flamenco is impossible for you after all.

04:40.780 --> 04:46.030
﻿Because you said that to me, I feel like I understand the flamenco a little better now.

04:46.820 --> 04:48.620
﻿Are you a fan of Jose?

04:48.620 --> 04:49.120
﻿Ah! You're...!

04:49.120 --> 04:50.450
﻿Ah! You're...!

04:50.870 --> 04:53.000
﻿I'm Carmen. Pleased to meet you.

04:55.710 --> 04:56.960
﻿I'm Nadja.

04:57.460 --> 04:59.710
﻿I'm also a big fan of his.

05:00.170 --> 05:01.840
﻿I'm not really what you'd call a fan.

05:02.130 --> 05:04.590
﻿It's just that I've had the chance to talk with Jose a little.

05:05.090 --> 05:06.800
﻿Eh? You've talked with Jose?

05:07.300 --> 05:11.560
﻿Thanks to Jose, I've become able to dance the flamenco.

05:12.180 --> 05:13.430
﻿Oh?

05:14.640 --> 05:16.140
﻿Ah, this is bad.

05:16.480 --> 05:19.150
﻿Señora told me not to have anything to do with Carmen.

05:19.860 --> 05:21.400
﻿Umm... Ms. Carmen.

05:21.480 --> 05:22.820
﻿You can call me Carmen.

05:22.820 --> 05:24.280
﻿Eh, ah, Carmen!

05:24.440 --> 05:27.070
﻿I have to hurry off and take care of something so, I'll be going now.

05:27.200 --> 05:28.820
﻿You have talent.

05:29.780 --> 05:33.450
Señora Anselma is infamous for not accepting but a handful of pupils.

05:34.080 --> 05:36.750
﻿I'm sure you'll definitely become a wonderful dancer.

05:37.960 --> 05:39.000
﻿No way...

05:40.040 --> 05:41.340
﻿This is no time to talk.

05:41.880 --> 05:44.460
﻿Did Señora tell you not to have anything to do with me or something?

05:44.460 --> 05:45.010
﻿Yes!

05:50.010 --> 05:51.680
﻿You're so easy to read!

05:51.930 --> 05:53.140
﻿I'm sorry.

05:55.270 --> 05:58.190
﻿Well, I guess Señora's anger is only to be expected.

05:58.900 --> 06:02.900
﻿She taught me with such enthusiasm, and yet I ended up throwing away the flamenco.

06:03.780 --> 06:04.610
﻿Threw it away?

06:04.860 --> 06:06.860
﻿Yeah, when I got married.

06:09.450 --> 06:11.990
﻿Ever since I went to England with my husband,

06:12.120 --> 06:13.240
﻿I haven't danced at all.

06:14.950 --> 06:16.580
﻿A lot of things happened.

06:17.040 --> 06:19.250
﻿And you were so good too. It seems like a waste.

06:19.710 --> 06:22.380
﻿If it were me, I would get so tempted that I wouldn't be able to stand it.

06:22.670 --> 06:24.630
Where do you dance?

06:25.590 --> 06:28.880
﻿I'm a dancer in a group of traveling performers called the Dandelion Troupe.

06:29.380 --> 06:30.590
﻿I'm still really inexperienced, though.

06:31.090 --> 06:32.930
﻿Well aren't you a splendid professional!

06:32.930 --> 06:34.560
﻿Maybe I should go and watch too.

06:34.930 --> 06:39.810
﻿Ah, but... tomorrow will be the first time I dance the flamenco in a performance.

06:40.270 --> 06:43.560
﻿would be great if I could please the Spanish people.

06:44.400 --> 06:46.230
﻿Let's go.

06:46.780 --> 06:49.650
﻿There's a place I went to before I danced that made me dance well afterwards.

06:50.070 --> 06:51.450
﻿Just a little something for good luck.

06:52.450 --> 06:53.620
What a nice person...

06:54.080 --> 06:57.700
﻿I'm sure Señora Anselma just misunderstands Carmen.

07:05.420 --> 07:06.920
﻿It's a nice view, right?

07:07.300 --> 07:10.550
﻿When I wanted to feel better, I'd often come here.

07:14.220 --> 07:15.600
﻿Isn't this place...?

07:16.470 --> 07:17.850
﻿Wanting to feel better...

07:18.600 --> 07:20.100
﻿I wonder if Jose was like this too.

07:22.730 --> 07:24.100
﻿It brings back memories!

07:24.310 --> 07:27.520
﻿A long time ago, I often came here with my lover to talk about our dreams.

07:27.780 --> 07:29.280
﻿Really? What kind of dreams?

07:29.570 --> 07:31.280
﻿Mine was to be a first-class dancer.

07:31.570 --> 07:33.910
He wanted to be a first-class matador.

07:34.370 --> 07:36.030
﻿Eh... a matador?

07:37.660 --> 07:38.450
﻿Let's go.

07:40.370 --> 07:41.830
A matador...

07:43.710 --> 07:45.380
﻿Next is this church.

07:46.800 --> 07:50.340
﻿If you pray here quietly, your heart will acquire peace.

07:51.050 --> 07:55.180
﻿Carmen, could it be that you also came here with your lover?

07:55.510 --> 07:57.640
﻿Yes, you figured that out pretty easily.

08:09.070 --> 08:10.150
﻿Isn't that...

08:14.030 --> 08:15.030
﻿Jose!

08:18.160 --> 08:18.910
﻿Carmen!

08:19.540 --> 08:22.580
﻿So those two were lovers after all.

08:23.830 --> 08:25.540
﻿I wanted to see you, Jose!

08:34.050 --> 08:35.800
﻿Don't touch me with such familiarity!

08:36.510 --> 08:37.470
﻿I'm sorry.

08:40.680 --> 08:42.890
﻿You've still been holding on to that?

08:44.190 --> 08:45.390
﻿Jose, wait!

08:46.560 --> 08:47.860
﻿I have something to talk to you about!

08:48.060 --> 08:48.730
﻿Jose?

08:59.120 --> 09:01.120
Jose﻿, where were you?

09:01.120 --> 09:02.330
﻿That's right.

09:02.330 --> 09:05.250
﻿If you're going out, at least tell someone that you're going out!

09:05.710 --> 09:07.960
﻿Hey, Jose! Open up!

09:08.210 --> 09:11.340
﻿All right, I understand. Just let your body rest for now.

09:14.010 --> 09:14.720
﻿Carmen.

09:16.930 --> 09:17.800
﻿Carmen!

09:21.970 --> 09:23.020
﻿Why?!

09:23.770 --> 09:26.480
﻿Why did you accept someone else's proposal?!

09:26.940 --> 09:29.480
﻿He's one of the richest men in all of England.

09:29.860 --> 09:31.940
﻿My luck has been rekindled.

09:32.360 --> 09:34.440
﻿Aren't we getting married?

09:35.070 --> 09:37.910
﻿Didn't we vow to each other on these joint pendants that we would?!

09:41.160 --> 09:42.030
﻿You mean this..

09:42.410 --> 09:43.620
﻿...cheap thing?

09:59.470 --> 10:00.180
﻿Carmen!

10:00.640 --> 10:02.390
I'll do anything for you!

10:02.760 --> 10:04.390
﻿I'll give you my life!

10:04.850 --> 10:05.970
﻿I love you!

10:06.350 --> 10:08.060
I love y﻿ou too. Jose.

10:08.520 --> 10:09.270
﻿Then whv?

10:09.480 --> 10:10.810
You're a wo﻿nderful person, but...

10:10.940 --> 10:13.730
﻿There's no telling if you'll really become some first-class matador.

10:13.860 --> 10:17.490
﻿There's no way having a mate like that would be able to make me happy.

10:18.030 --> 10:18.740
﻿Carmen!

10:22.410 --> 10:25.580
C﻿armen!!

10:42.180 --> 10:43.760
I ﻿was so foolish.

10:44.890 --> 10:47.980
﻿Setting my sights on money, I betrayed Jose.

10:48.810 --> 10:50.480
﻿But once I left, I realized...

10:50.730 --> 10:53.560
﻿...that the one I truly loved was Jose.

10:55.280 --> 10:57.820
﻿There wasn't a second that went by where I would forget about him.

10:58.320 --> 10:59.530
I ﻿feel like I understand.

11:00.240 --> 11:01.820
﻿No matter how far apart you are.

11:02.280 --> 11:06.790
﻿No, I mean... it's because you're, far apart, you want to see that person.

11:10.540 --> 11:12.960
﻿You have one too, don't you? Someone you love...

11:14.130 --> 11:17.000
﻿Someone I love? I'm not so sure about that.

11:17.340 --> 11:19.800
﻿But, I have someone that I really like.

11:23.090 --> 11:26.220
﻿If I could be near Jose, I don't need anything else.

11:26.510 --> 11:29.270
﻿But, I did something that terrible to him.

11:29.810 --> 11:31.190
﻿He'll never forgive me.

11:31.390 --> 11:32.560
﻿That's not true!

11:32.810 --> 11:34.060
﻿Somehow I have this feeling that...

11:34.190 --> 11:37.190
﻿...Jose hasn't forgotten about you either for all this time.

11:37.360 --> 11:39.990
﻿But, he didn't even listen to me.

11:40.950 --> 11:44.280
﻿Leave it to me! I'll definitely bring Jose back!

11:51.210 --> 11:53.420
﻿I'm counting on you, young lady.

12:14.400 --> 12:16.440
﻿If you want an autograph, I'll have to turn you away.,

12:16.730 --> 12:19.940
﻿I don't want an autograph! I have something important to talk to Jose about.

12:20.030 --> 12:21.900
﻿Everyone says that.

12:21.990 --> 12:25.110
Sorry, but Jose told us not to let anyone through.

12:25.570 --> 12:27.370
﻿Can't you just let me see him? Please!

12:27.530 --> 12:29.200
﻿I have something really important to talk to him about.

12:29.370 --> 12:32.080
﻿It's no good, no good. Just who are you anyway?

12:36.540 --> 12:38.380
﻿A dancer.

12:40.130 --> 12:41.550
﻿So, I'll just leave it at that.

12:42.550 --> 12:43.220
Go home. Go home.

12:43.720 --> 12:45.550
No! Let go of me!

12:45.760 --> 12:48.140
﻿Jose! Jose!

12:50.560 --> 12:51.180
﻿Come in!

12:53.140 --> 12:54.430
﻿Could you please let go of me?

12:55.440 --> 12:56.100
﻿Thank you!

12:56.770 --> 12:57.900
﻿Sorry to intru--!

12:59.400 --> 13:00.520
﻿What is this?

13:02.820 --> 13:05.450
﻿This is so dangerous! The vase is broken.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.740
Did Carmen ask you to come?

13:10.410 --> 13:12.740
﻿Carmen said she wants to talk with you.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.620
﻿She'll be waiting at Guell Park.

13:16.120 --> 13:16.830
﻿Now after all this time?

13:18.630 --> 13:22.500
﻿Jose. Why were you at the church in Guell Park?

13:24.340 --> 13:27.340
﻿You were walking through a place full of memories with Carmen, right?

13:28.430 --> 13:32.180
﻿Carmen said that the one she truly loves is you, Jose.

13:32.640 --> 13:35.350
﻿She said that there wasn't a single day when she forgot that.

13:36.600 --> 13:37.350
﻿Jose?

13:49.990 --> 13:52.120
I ﻿was murdered by Carmen.

13:52.540 --> 13:53.240
﻿Eh?

13:53.370 --> 13:56.330
﻿Do you know why I became a first class matador?

13:57.120 --> 13:58.790
﻿When she betrayed me,

13:59.170 --> 14:01.210
﻿my heart died.

14:01.590 --> 14:04.050
﻿A bullfighter is someone that has conquered his fear of death.

14:04.340 --> 14:06.010
﻿But no matter what kind of bullfighter you are,

14:06.090 --> 14:08.010
﻿you can never completely eliminate that fear.

14:08.590 --> 14:11.260
﻿Everyone still fears death somewhere deep within their hearts.

14:11.890 --> 14:12.970
﻿But I'm different!

14:13.390 --> 14:14.640
﻿I'm not afraid of death!

14:16.020 --> 14:17.850
﻿I always tell that to the bull in the ring.

14:18.480 --> 14:20.060
﻿My heart is right here.

14:20.190 --> 14:21.230
﻿Come and get it!

14:21.730 --> 14:23.440
﻿But none of the bulls have been able to kill me.

14:24.280 --> 14:25.480
﻿That's why I kill them.

14:25.860 --> 14:27.490
﻿Because they can't get me first!

14:27.950 --> 14:28.700
﻿No way...

14:29.450 --> 14:31.450
﻿I've always prayed to God.

14:31.870 --> 14:35.410
﻿I want to die soon. Please hurry and take this life of mine!

14:35.620 --> 14:36.410
﻿You stupid!

14:36.620 --> 14:38.290
﻿Why are you saying stuff like that?!

14:39.460 --> 14:42.750
﻿Everyone in this world is trying their hardest to live out their lives.

14:43.000 --> 14:45.090
﻿Even through hardships, they try their best.

14:45.340 --> 14:46.590
﻿Even so, to want to die...!

14:47.010 --> 14:50.470
﻿My heart is already dead. There's nothing I can do if my body lives on.

14:50.800 --> 14:52.390
﻿Carmen regrets what she did.

14:52.550 --> 14:54.220
﻿Saying that she did something terrible to you.

14:54.510 --> 14:55.760
﻿Just forget about it already.

14:58.390 --> 14:59.850
﻿Go and talk to Carmen!

15:01.310 --> 15:03.020
﻿There's nothing to talk about.

15:03.360 --> 15:04.090
So you're running away?

15:04.420 --> 15:05.940
Run away? Me?

15:05.940 --> 15:07.030
﻿You're running away, aren't you?

15:07.190 --> 15:10.610
﻿Even if you drink alcohol, or break a vase, nothing will change!

15:11.490 --> 15:13.120
﻿If you're not afraid of death,

15:13.280 --> 15:15.580
﻿listening to her talk should be no big deal, right?

15:40.520 --> 15:42.600
Jose. I love you.

15:43.480 --> 15:46.690
﻿Never come before me again. I came here to say that.

15:48.050 --> 15:48.570
Jose!

15:48.570 --> 15:49.360
﻿Give it up already.

15:49.780 --> 15:51.190
﻿I already know what you're scheming.

15:51.650 --> 15:53.200
﻿You're just tired of being rich.

15:53.450 --> 15:56.410
﻿You're probably thinking that you should try being with someone famed as being a "hero".

15:57.030 --> 15:58.160
﻿What an shameful woman you are.

15:58.660 --> 16:01.080
﻿Do you hate me?

16:02.710 --> 16:05.830
﻿That's right. It's natural that you'd hate me.

16:06.130 --> 16:07.840
﻿But once I left, I realized it.

16:08.090 --> 16:10.420
﻿That there really is no one else for me except you.

16:10.670 --> 16:13.590
﻿There wasn't a single day that I didn't think of you.

16:14.050 --> 16:15.590
﻿Weren't you like that too?

16:16.760 --> 16:17.600
﻿Jose!

16:18.640 --> 16:19.430
﻿Jose.

16:19.810 --> 16:22.230
Ah! Carmen, what are you?!

16:26.520 --> 16:28.020
﻿That's dangerous! Come down from there!

16:28.520 --> 16:30.070
﻿There's no one but you.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.860
﻿If I can't be near you,

16:32.360 --> 16:33.990
﻿there's no point in living!

16:34.240 --> 16:36.450
Carmen! Stop acting foolish!

16:37.120 --> 16:38.660
﻿It's no use.

16:39.450 --> 16:41.370
﻿If you're that set on jumping, you might as well jump.

16:42.710 --> 16:45.120
﻿Your actions don't affect me in any way.

16:45.500 --> 16:46.250
﻿Jose...

16:49.090 --> 16:49.840
﻿Carmen!

17:11.440 --> 17:12.190
﻿Jose!

17:16.780 --> 17:17.820
﻿I love you.

17:29.210 --> 17:30.170
﻿Carmen!

17:31.460 --> 17:33.170
﻿Thank goodness!

17:39.180 --> 17:41.510
﻿With this, the hero is mine.

17:53.820 --> 17:54.610
﻿Nadja.

17:56.530 --> 17:58.200
﻿Jose! Carmen!

17:58.450 --> 17:59.780
﻿You came to see me!

18:00.240 --> 18:01.280
﻿Good luck!

18:01.620 --> 18:04.330
﻿Just believe in yourself and dance your heart out. Things will turn out fine.

18:07.540 --> 18:12.210
﻿After coming to this country, I understand why I like dancing so much.

18:12.960 --> 18:17.010
﻿Through dancing, things like pain and loneliness can be changed into happiness.

18:17.590 --> 18:19.800
﻿After dancing the flamenco, I figured that out.

18:20.430 --> 18:22.430
﻿I'm really glad I came to Spain!

18:23.180 --> 18:25.270
﻿Watch me, okay? My flamenco!

18:26.230 --> 18:27.310
﻿Thank you for waiting.

18:27.520 --> 18:29.850
﻿The Dandelion Troupe presents to you a new dance!

18:29.850 --> 18:33.520
﻿The Miraculous Flamenco Show brought to you by the Dancing Princess Nadja!

19:04.970 --> 19:06.600
﻿Carmen, you're tired, right?

19:06.720 --> 19:08.140
﻿Why don't you rest a little.

19:08.140 --> 19:08.850
﻿No, Señora.

19:09.270 --> 19:10.890
﻿I haven't danced nearly enough.

19:11.060 --> 19:13.150
﻿I want to dance more and more!

19:18.070 --> 19:18.740
﻿Carmen.

19:19.610 --> 19:21.200
﻿It might already be too late for me.

19:21.990 --> 19:23.990
﻿When I stand in front of a bull, I start shaking.

19:24.280 --> 19:26.830
﻿Jose. No matter who you are, it's normal for you to be scared.

19:27.290 --> 19:29.790
﻿I'm sure you'll definitely become a first-class matador.

19:30.160 --> 19:32.750
﻿After all, you're the one I chose.

19:33.040 --> 19:33.670
﻿Carmen!

19:34.340 --> 19:36.750
﻿I'm going to become a first-class dancer.

19:37.090 --> 19:39.090
﻿That's why, Jose, do your best as well.

19:47.470 --> 19:49.560
﻿Carmen, you're not going to dance anymore?

19:50.600 --> 19:52.980
﻿Didn't we say that we'd become the best together?

19:53.150 --> 19:54.350
﻿It doesn't matter anymore.

19:54.610 --> 19:56.230
﻿I have you.

19:57.070 --> 19:58.400
﻿That's enough.

20:09.080 --> 20:11.580
﻿Wow! What a lovely pendant!

20:11.790 --> 20:13.830
﻿Yeah... it's the sign of engagement.

20:14.500 --> 20:15.920
﻿Huh? An engagement?

20:16.500 --> 20:17.090
﻿So that means..

20:17.250 --> 20:19.090
﻿We're getting married!

20:19.260 --> 20:22.420
