20:23.050 --> 20:26.260
﻿Umm... Ah! I hope you two will be happy forever!

20:27.350 --> 20:27.850
﻿Yeah...

20:28.310 --> 20:29.810
﻿Thank you, Nadja.

20:49.240 --> 20:51.330
﻿To become a top-notch Spanish bull fighter...

20:51.750 --> 20:52.950
﻿I fulfilled my dream.

20:53.460 --> 20:55.580
﻿Also, Carmen came back to me, and we're engaged.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.250
